    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i cant even look at the news anymore. it feels like everything is just... collapsing. every time i try to think about the future or even just plan for next year, it feels like a joke. what's the point in building anything or caring about anything when the math is just so clearly against us? it feels like we're all just watching a slow motion car crash and pretending it's not happening.",
